d prompt constraints, so the shootout really points toward which family to pursue rather than being a definitive ranking.\n\nThe eGPU is hitting 13-33 tokens/second on the 8-9B models, which is solid, though the rocblaslt kernel for gfx1200 is still missing and degrading prefill performance. Looking at the throughput across models, qwen3.5-9b reaches 27-32 t/s, deepseek-r1-qwen3-8b ranges 13-33 t/s, and gemma-4-12b-qat is slower at 2.8-9.6 t/s. I need to document this evidence and log it to the board, though the formal T0 contract and training execution are gated.\n\nI'll append the shootout results and eGPU findings to LOG.md and report back to the user. The T0 evidence doc is part of the gated training phase, so I'll keep this recon lightweight—logging the board entry is the right move, and I can offer to write a formal evidence file if needed rather than creating repo files preemptively.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1408,"cache_read_input_tokens":152324,"output_tokens":2841,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1408,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2841,"cache_read_input_tokens":152324,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1408},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHRPLgKq6WBsFhTN6yz7","type":"assistant","uuid":"edf8be42-e930-4acd-8ec6-def92f12d015","timestamp":"2026-07-22T16:36:20.312Z","effort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16","sessionId":"61a9f7a2-1353-4f19-addd-895289cb8f19","version":"2.1.217","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
