er/` + a resolve_executor hook,\n  served by **LM Studio on the eGPU** (owner: LM Studio + eGPU only). Live: ran a real ADR-004\n  offload task, gemma-3-4b judge scored 1.0, status=passed, no-regression vs qwen3.5-9b.\n  Integration fix (allowlist amended +gate.py): `run_judge` sent `response_format:json_object`\n  which **LM Studio 400s** (needs json_schema/text) — provider-agnostic retry-without. Verify:\n  `python scripts/gates/t4.py` with the tuned GGUF loaded in LM Studio.\n- **T5 (DPO) IN PROGRESS (2026-07-25):** self-generated hard negatives — for train-split\n  prompts, the served SFT model's greedy answer when wrong vs the corpus reference becomes\n  (chosen=reference, rejected=SFT-answer). 749 pairs generated via LM Studio; **filtered to 303\n  method pairs** (117 wrong-tool-selection + 186 voice-drift) — args_mismatch (446) DROPPED as\n  fact-cramming (arg values are RAG facts, not method). SFT baseline = v3 tuned eval (reused,\n  deterministic). DPO: beta 0.1, lr 5e-6, 1 epoch, max_length 1024. First run WEDGED at step\n  8/38 (eGPU hang, 6h frozen — [[verify-gpu-job-liveness]]); relaunched. Code: scripts/train/dpo/\n  {build_prefs,train_dpo}.py, scripts/gates/t5.py (no_prefs|no_eval|dpo_worse|gguf_load_fail).\n- **Data-v3 COMPLETE, all pre-registered criteria PASSED (2026-07-24):** 7,042-row\n  dataset (A 1,741+301 from six house sources incl. sessions_v1 JSON cards; B 4,201+799\n  full sweep, Bash capped 20%). Result on the 1,102-row split: base agg_nll 2.6195 →\n  tuned **1.1253 (−57.0%)**; **A_nll −38.3%** (v2: −9.2% — data levers worked, 4×),\n  B_nll −70.5%, tool-match 0.170→0.263. v3 GGUF supersedes v2 at\n  `D:\\t3-merge\\gguf_gguf\\` (T4 serves this one). Conclusion on record: the A-gap was\n  data scarcity, not a method ceiling — **T5/DPO (contract authored) is next by choice**.\n  Gold 200-row hand-audit (`dataset/gold_sample.jsonl`) still owner-owed.\n- **T5 authored** (DPO on the SFT adapter; self-generated hard negatives from the TRAIN\n  s